              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na akĩvw’ĩka thaavu mũtheu, ĩũlũ wakyo, na mavava makyo onthe, na mbya syakyo: na akĩseũvĩsya ũengo mũtũlu wa thaavu ũkĩlingĩle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
